  "rights_gate": {
    "correos": "The current public product page requires a paid contract. Its licence limits use to the contractor's own database/address quality, prohibits sublicensing and prohibits a public postcode search for unrelated users. The page proves Andorra postcode rows are in the basic database but does not expressly prove that the cartographic overlay includes Andorra.",
    "govern": "The reviewed website legal notice limits content to private/personal use and prohibits commercial reuse; the download portal requires user data and acceptance of dataset conditions. No conditions were accepted and no bulk dataset was downloaded.",
    "upu": "The format sheet and historical article establish semantics and implementation history. Current POST*CODE data is presented through licence documents, contract and rates, not as an open reusable polygon release.",
    "decision": "No reviewed source grants the complete rights needed for a public immutable AD postcode-area artifact and AGID API/app serving.",
    "legal_conclusion_claimed": false
  },
